  "description": "This package provides WebView support for CodeBrix.Platform Skia apps on Linux - all three heads: X11, Wayland, and FrameBuffer. Web content is rendered offscreen by the system-installed WPE WebKit engine (sudo apt install libwpewebkit-2.0-1 libwpebackend-fdo-1.0-1 libwpe-1.0-1) and composited directly into the Skia scene; no engine binaries are shipped in this package. Reference it once, in your app's .Core project, like the other extension add-ons: every head gets it, the Linux heads activate it, and it is inert on the Windows, Skia-on-WPF, and macOS heads (which have built-in WebView support).",
  "iconFile": "icon-codebrix-128.png",
